{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118405","id":3517365097,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Rprtp","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118405","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118405.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118405.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118405","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118405/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118405/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118405/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/24f9ac81bab799683eb7e1af48a619c4d5688cbc","number":118405,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Random raytracing fixes","user":{"login":"Fahien","id":6058008,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTgwMDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6058008?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien","html_url":"https://github.com/Fahien","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fahien/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Add device address flag to SBT buffer\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nCheck error when updating hit SBT\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nFix shader binding table record alignment:\r\n\r\nRaytracing shader binding table records are addressed through Vulkan\r\nalignment rules that distinguish between the raw shader group handle size,\r\nthe per-record handle alignment, and the base alignment required for SBT\r\nregion addresses.\r\n\r\nThe previous layout treated the shader group handle size as the record\r\nstride everywhere. This worked only on devices where the handle size\r\nalready satisfied all relevant alignment requirements. It broke down once\r\nmultiple ray generation shaders were placed in the same SBT: selecting a\r\nnon-zero raygen index advanced the raygen region address by the raw handle\r\nsize, which could produce an address that was not aligned to the required\r\nshader group base alignment.\r\n\r\nSeparate the SBT layout into the appropriate strides:\r\n\r\n- ray generation records use a base-aligned stride, since selecting a\r\n  raygen shader changes the SBT region start address for the dispatch.\r\n- miss and hit records use the handle-aligned shader group stride, since\r\n  their regions start at a base-aligned address and individual records are\r\n  selected through the region stride.\r\n\r\nThis keeps the CPU-side SBT population and the dispatch-time SBT regions\r\nusing the same layout, so shader group handles are written to the same\r\naligned slots that Vulkan later addresses.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com